Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Return compact trace summaries and bounded logs from MCP
 telemetry tools

list_traces now returns one small summary per trace (ID, title, duration, error
flag, resources, slowest child span, first failed span) and accepts 'limit' and
'traceId'. list_structured_logs accepts 'limit' and 'severity' and returns the
latest 30 entries by default instead of filling an 8k-token budget.
